### Single ticket triage (renders Go template into state, then evaluates TriageDecision schema)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Acme Corp",
  "plan": "enterprise",
  "subject": "Duplicate charge on March invoice",
  "message": "We were billed twice for March. Please refund the duplicate today or we cancel.",
  "tags": ["billing", "duplicate"]
}

### Batch ticket triage
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/triage/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tickets": [
    {
      "customer": "Acme Corp",
      "plan": "enterprise",
      "subject": "Duplicate charge on March invoice",
      "message": "We were billed twice for March. Please refund the duplicate today or we cancel.",
      "tags": ["billing", "duplicate"]
    },
    {
      "customer": "Beta LLC",
      "plan": "starter",
      "subject": "Enterprise contract expansion",
      "message": "We want pricing to expand our contract to 250 seats.",
      "tags": ["expansion"]
    }
  ]
}
